[agent:result]       Lakehouse Federation. 2. Postgres table named "{table}" in schema
[agent:result]       "{schema}" in the connected Postgres database
[agent:result] 
[agent:result] Usage:
[agent:result]   databricks postgres create-synced-table SYNCED_TABLE_ID [flags]
